    "description": "Play NEW F1\u00ae Clash for FREE! Test your wits and emerge victorious in the definitive F1\u00ae motorsport manager experience on mobile \u2014 F1\u00ae Clash!\r\n\r\nCompete in thrilling 1v1 racing contests with the toughest rival race drivers from around the world. From PVP Duels and Monthly Exhibitions to Weekly Leagues and Grand Prix\u2122 events held every F1\u00ae race day, there are endless ways for a manager to make a name for themselves. Will you, as a manager, tell your Drivers to go all out from the first lap, or play the long game and sneak victory on the final corner?\r\n\r\nOFFICIAL FORMULA ONE CONTENT \r\nFeaturing all the official Circuits, Teams, and Drivers from the 2024 FIA Formula One World Championship\u2122, including Lewis Hamilton, Max Verstappen, Lando Norris, and Charles Leclerc. This content is essential for any true F1\u00ae manager.\r\n\r\nBEAT YOUR RIVAL \r\nRise through the Leagues as a skilled manager and win chequered flags to earn epic rewards! Show your racing expertise and strategic prowess as a manager.\r\n\r\nSEIZE THE INITIATIVE \r\nMake split-second management decisions as you go head-to-head in exciting PvP racing modes! Prove your worth as the ultimate F1\u00ae manager.\r\n\r\nRACE TOGETHER \r\nJoin a Club and work as a team \u2014 earn Reputation for your Club and compete in Exhibitions to win legendary perks. Strong manager cooperation is key in every race!\r\n\r\nTAKE CONTROL\r\n Recruit and train real-life F1\u00ae Drivers to create your ultimate team, complete with unique custom liveries and detailed car tuning. Show your manager skills by building the best racing team.\r\n\r\nDEEP STRATEGY \r\nSet your pit stop strategy while keeping your wits about you in the heat of the race. React to weather changes, worn tyres, and severe crashes as you push your vehicles to the limit. Pull off genius tactical management orders, demonstrating your prowess as an F1\u00ae manager in every race.\r\n\r\nUPDATED GRAPHICS \r\nTour the globe to race on stunning real-life F1\u00ae Circuits. Experience the visual thrills that every F1\u00ae manager and racing enthusiast dreams of.\r\n\r\nPLEASE NOTE! F1\u00ae Clash is free to download and play. However, some in-game items can also be purchased for real money. F1\u00ae Clash includes loot boxes that drop the available items in randomised order. Information about drop rates can be found by selecting a crate in-game and tapping the 'Drop Rates' button. Crates can be purchased using in-game currency ('Bucks'), earned through gameplay or won.\r\n\r\nUnder our Terms of Service and Privacy Policy, you must be at least 13 years of age to play or download F1\u00ae Clash.\r\n\r\nA network connection is also required to participate in every race.\r\n\r\nTerms of Service \r\nhttp://www.hutchgames.com/terms-of-service/\r\n\r\nPrivacy Policy\r\nhttp://www.hutchgames.com/privacy/\r\n\r\nCredits \r\nhttp://www.hutchgames.com/f1-clash-credits/\r\n\r\nNeed help?\r\n\r\nYou can reach out to us in-game by going to Settings -> Help & Support, or alternatively, you can raise a support ticket by heading here - https://hutch.helpshift.com/hc/en/10-f1-clash/contact-us/\r\n\r\nFollow us!\r\n\r\nInstagram - https://www.instagram.com/f1clashgame \r\nFacebook - https://www.facebook.com/F1ClashGame \r\nX - https://twitter.com/F1ClashGame \r\nTikTok - https://www.tiktok.com/@f1clashgame \r\nYoutube - https://www.youtube.com/@f1clashgame \r\nTwitch - https://www.twitch.tv/f1clashgame\r\n\r\nJoin the community on the Official F1\u00ae Clash Discord Server!\r\n\r\nhttps://discord.gg/f1clash",
